DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T153000
UID:30eb6dadf5da1d53c73db8bc86476cca@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Meet three members of the raptor family\, a falcon\, a hawk\, 
 and an owl. Get an up-close look at the physical structures\, feather type
 s and wing shapes that allow these predators to survive in the wild. Explo
 re these adaptations in person and watch a live flight demonstration. Pres
 ented by the West Coast Falconry.
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Small Conference Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Br
 anch Library
